"@type": "urn:bedrock:ontology/Decision"
label: "Retain qualified HNSW, keep exact dense search for current Semble scale"
timestamp: "2026-09-05T13:40:31Z"
status: "concluded-not-adopted"
promise: >
  Determine whether filtered fast-hnsw should replace exact brute-force dense
  retrieval for Semble immutable baselines on the production four-vCPU,
  32-GiB r3-32 automation runner while holding the model, vectors, BM25, RRF,
  reranking, corpus, and query set constant.
